五、v5 最终版分析 (2026-06-11)
================================================================================

【解压】 kv-cache-learned-v5-final.zip

【v5改进】
  1. 修复free事件Bug: 新增sim_mask机制
     - free事件仅用于特征预计算(F7 free_events_seen)
     - 仿真流过滤为 access+allocate
     - LRU基线恢复到正确的14.76% (v4为14.50%)
  
  2. 特征重设计:
     F4: relative_block_idx → log_access_count (对数防饱和)
     F5: generation_speed → interval_trend (recent_mean/all_mean趋势比)
     F6: recent_freq_ratio → tail_density (尾部集中度)
     F7: active_seqs_online → free_events_seen (生命周期释放数)

【v5最终结果】
  Cache | LRU     | FIFO   | Learned  | Learned vs LRU
  100   | 14.76%  | 1.08%  | 19.73%   | +4.97pp (+33.7%)
  200   | 34.40%  | 1.84%  | 38.28%   | +3.88pp (+11.3%)
  500   | 78.85%  | 79.02% | 86.88%   | +8.03pp (+10.2%)
  1000+ | 99.77%  | 99.77% | 99.77%   | 平

  v5 vs v4: +1.01pp (100) / +1.51pp (200) / -0.99pp (500)

【v5特征 (8维, 纯在线, 无未来泄露)】
  F0: ref_count_norm       — 当前并发共享数
  F1: access_count_norm    — 历史访问量
  F2: time_since_last      — 距上次访问
  F3: interval_cv          — 间隔变异系数
  F4: log_access_count     — 对数访问量(防饱和)
  F5: interval_trend       — 加速/减速趋势
  F6: tail_density         — 尾部集中度
  F7: free_events_seen     — 生命周期释放数

